{
  "id": "slow_push_in",
  "title_zh": "缓慢推进（氛围感）",
  "version": 4,
  "scope": "I2VA,FL2VA,L2VA,Ref2VA",
  "category": "camera",
  "source": "MiniMax-H3 official h3-prompt-writing camera vocabulary + community ambience recipe",
  "source_url": "https://github.com/MiniMax-AI/MiniMax-H3/tree/main/skills/h3-prompt-writing",
  "evidence_level": "official_aligned",
  "features": ["slow_push_in", "primary_camera", "composition_continuity"],
  "conflicts": [],
  "semantic_contract": {
    "purpose": "使用一次克制、连续的缓慢推进强化注意力或情绪，不改写主体动作。",
    "adds": [
      {"path": "camera.motion.primary", "value": "slow_push_in"}
    ],
    "preserves": [
      "subject.identity",
      "subject.user_requested_action",
      "continuity.composition_anchor",
      "continuity.perspective"
    ],
    "forbids": [
      "zoom_out",
      "rapid_zoom",
      "camera_shake",
      "jump_cut",
      "invent_subject_motion_to_justify_camera"
    ],
    "defaults": [
      {"path": "camera.motion.amplitude", "value": "subtle"},
      {"path": "camera.motion.speed", "value": "gradual"}
    ]
  },
  "ownership": {
    "reads": ["subject.anchor", "subject.user_requested_action"],
    "writes": ["camera.motion.primary"],
    "augments": ["continuity.composition"]
  },
  "resolution": {
    "exclusive_group": "camera.motion.primary",
    "priority": 50,
    "requires": [],
    "conflicts": []
  },
  "instructions": "缓慢推进主运镜规则：从既有构图朝叙事关注点进行一次连续、克制的 slow push-in，用于建立氛围、铺垫悬念或收束情绪。\n1. 推进方向、目标和结束景别必须明确；速度保持缓慢、平顺，幅度以不破坏原构图和透视为限。\n2. 本规则只主导相机推进，不替主体新增呼吸、眨眼、转身或其他动作；主体继续执行用户原本要求，细微动态可由独立规则补充。\n3. 保持主体身份、空间关系、构图锚点和背景结构连续，不把光学 zoom、突然裁切或景别跳变伪装成真实推进。\n4. 不反向拉远、不快速变焦、不抖动、不切镜；到达目标构图后稳定停住。"
}
